# Docker reads this from the BUILD CONTEXT ROOT, not from the directory
# holding the Dockerfile. Putting it in docker/ silently does nothing —
# which shipped a stale vendor/CrispASR/build-static into the image and
# broke the build with a CMakeCache path mismatch.
#
# No trailing slashes: .dockerignore matching is filepath.Match, and the
# slash forms are unreliable across builder versions.
models
**/build
**/build-*
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
.git
**/.DS_Store
*.gguf
*.tar
out
